I decided to post this here as it's more pertaining to the tinytex aspect of Rmarkdown. I'm having an issue running the render function via Rmarkdown on a VM, as I'm contributing to a project that requires converting an Rmd file to PDF to happen outside of RStudio. However, I'm running into this error after the entire Rmd file is processed, and I haven't found a viable solution yet. I've tried to re-install tinytex, re-installing the Rmarkdown library, added this piece of code to the Rmd file from another [solution](https://github.com/readthedocs/readthedocs.org/issues/2127#issuecomment-216505432): 

```
\IfFileExists{xcolor.sty}{
    \RequirePackage{xcolor}
}{
    \RequirePackage{color}
}
```

But nothing has worked. The Rmd file renders/converts to PDF fine on RStudio, so it probably has nothing to do with the code and sourced R codes in the file themselves. If there are any other solutions, I'm all ears and thank you in advance.

